Package: epicurious
Type: Package
Title: Epigenome-Wide Association with CpG-Specific SNP Adjustment
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("epi-curious", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "maintainer@example.org")
Description: Fits ordinary least squares models of DNA methylation on a
    phenotype and covariates, adding predefined SNP dosages separately for
    each CpG. Provides explicit sample alignment, complete-case analysis,
    model diagnostics, multiple-testing correction, and reproducible exports.
    Includes a dependency-free example and a command-line workflow.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, utils, parallel
NeedsCompilation: no
